[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7381.99, "timestamp": "02:03:01", "text": "毕业就像你独立音乐的那一面，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7385.83, "timestamp": "02:03:05", "text": "账户之类的东西，但他们私下里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7389.99, "timestamp": "02:03:09", "text": "是的。是的。我喜欢这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7393.47, "timestamp": "02:03:13", "text": "哦，所以他们正在使用引擎盖下的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7395.669, "timestamp": "02:03:15", "text": "策略。说实话，我完全赞成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7397.27, "timestamp": "02:03:17", "text": "他们在独立制作方面能赚到更多钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7399.35, "timestamp": "02:03:19", "text": "我猜的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7401.669, "timestamp": "02:03:21", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7404.39, "timestamp": "02:03:24", "text": "嗯，也算合理。那真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7406.39, "timestamp": "02:03:26", "text": "好的。你为了赚更多钱而做什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7409.51, "timestamp": "02:03:29", "text": "我的意思是，为什么要付钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7412.149, "timestamp": "02:03:32", "text": "企业？只需支付到一定金额即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7413.91, "timestamp": "02:03:33", "text": "重点是，他们要替换"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7417.03, "timestamp": "02:03:37", "text": "无论如何，将来你都会得到这样的结果。我唯一的故事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7419.189, "timestamp": "02:03:39", "text": "我知道我又重新成为了一名 YouTuber"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7420.79, "timestamp": "02:03:40", "text": "这是俄罗斯的故事。我不知道该怎么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7425.109, "timestamp": "02:03:45", "text": "她现在正在做，但是我的天哪。我是说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7428.87, "timestamp": "02:03:48", "text": "她离开了维绍乔和维绍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7430.79, "timestamp": "02:03:50", "text": "显然，让他们让她拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7433.83, "timestamp": "02:03:53", "text": "模型之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7435.91, "timestamp": "02:03:55", "text": "到底是什么？是啊，就让他们去吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7438.31, "timestamp": "02:03:58", "text": "模型之类的东西。所以她有时"}]